<title>UK: DEUTSCHE BANK UNIT SETS 400 MLN DKR BOND.</title>
<headline>DEUTSCHE BANK UNIT SETS 400 MLN DKR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BANK FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    29.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.591   PAY DATE   L19.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
